 =3\\cdot 4-(-6)\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =12-(-30) \\\\  & =42.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/state.json" "file_sha256" "ef0ef501505ad15b3d918fd486037e8f3ae2d9f64de5fbc1634c9290ec735998"} {"question" "q-1092" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "10f9a01882929c805ae8f03f880f100764bc453c1ee7d0fe363e3949f3e61664"} {"question" "q-1092" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/state.json" "file_sha256" "ef0ef501505ad15b3d918fd486037e8f3ae2d9f64de5fbc1634c9290ec735998"} {"question" "q-1092" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-18"] ["math" "-42"] ["math" "28"] ["math" "3"] ["math" "42"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/state.json" "file_sha256" "ef0ef501505ad15b3d918fd486037e8f3ae2d9f64de5fbc1634c9290ec735998"} {"question" "q-1092" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "42"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/state.json" "file_sha256" "ef0ef501505ad15b3d918fd486037e8f3ae2d9f64de5fbc1634c9290ec735998"} {"question" "q-319110" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "For the matrix\n$Y=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 5 \\\\ 3 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 6 & -1 & 2\\end{aligned}].$\nfind the minor ${M}_{32}$ of the entry ${y}_{32}.$\n\n${M}_{32}=${{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/state.json" "file_sha256" "ef0ef501505ad15b3d918fd486037e8f3ae2d9f64de5fbc1634c9290ec735998"} {"question" "q-319110" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The minor of ${y}_{32}=-1$ (third row, second column) is the determinant of the remaining entries when the column and row containing $-1$ are removed: \n\n$$\nY=[\\begin{aligned}1 & ∗ & 5 \\\\ 3 & ∗ & 0 \\\\ ∗ & -1 & ∗\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the minor of ${y}_{32}=-1$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{M}_{32} & =\\text{det}[\\begin{aligned}1 & 5 \\\\ 3 & 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}1 & 5 \\\\ 3 & 0\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(1)\\cdot 0-3\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =0-15 \\\\  & =-15.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/state.json" "file_sha256" "ef0ef501505ad15b3d918fd486037e8f3ae2d9f64de5fbc1634c9290ec735998"} {"question" "q-319110" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "10f9a01882929c805ae8f03f880f100764bc453c1ee7d0fe363e3949f3e61664"} {"question" "q-319110" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/state.json" "file_sha256" "ef0ef501505ad15b3d918fd486037e8f3ae2d9f64de5fbc1634c9290ec735998"} {"question" "q-319110" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-15"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/state.json" "file_sha256" "ef0ef501505ad15b3d918fd486037e8f3ae2d9f64de5fbc1634c9290ec735998"} {"question" "q-69760" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the minor of ${t}_{33}$ in the matrix\n$T=[\\begin{aligned}y-x & x & {y}^{2} \\\\ -x & y+x & 1 \\\\ {x}^{2} & {y}^{2} & {x}^{2}\\end{aligned}]?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/state.json" "file_sha256" "ef0ef501505ad15b3d918fd486037e8f3ae2d9f64de5fbc1634c9290ec735998"} {"question" "q-69760" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we remove the third row and third column:\n\n$$\nT=[\\begin{aligned}y-x & x & ∗ \\\\ -x & y+x & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗ & {x}^{2}\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nNext, we calculate the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det[\\begin{aligned}y-x & x \\\\ -x & y+x\\end{aligned}] & =|\\begin{aligned}y-x & x \\\\ -x & y+x\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(y-x)\\cdot (y+x)-x\\cdot (-x) \\\\  & ={y}^{2}-{x}^{2}+{x}^{2} \\\\  & ={y}^{2}-\\cancel{{x}^{2}}+\\cancel{{x}^{2}} \\\\  & ={y}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/state.json" "file_sha256" "ef0ef501505ad15b3d918fd486037e8f3ae2d9f64de5fbc1634c9290ec735998"} {"question" "q-69760" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "10f9a01882929c805ae8f03f880f100764bc453c1ee7d0fe363e3949f3e61664"} {"question" "q-69760" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/state.json" "file_sha256" "ef0ef501505ad15b3d918fd486037e8f3ae2d9f64de5fbc1634c9290ec735998"} {"question" "q-69760" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-{x}^{2}"] ["math" "{x}^{2}"] ["math" "{x}^{2}-2{y}^{2}"] ["math" "{y}^{2}"] ["math" "{y}^{2}-2{x}^{2}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/state.json" "file_sha256" "ef0ef501505ad15b3d918fd486037e8f3ae2d9f64de5fbc1634c9290ec735998"} {"question" "q-69760" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "{y}^{2}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/state.json" "file_sha256" "ef0ef501505ad15b3d918fd486037e8f3ae2d9f64de5fbc1634c9290ec735998"} {"question" "q-1099" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the minor of ${d}_{32}$ in the matrix\n$D=[\\begin{aligned}3s & -{r}^{2} & 2t \\\\ -r & 0 & r \\\\ 5t & 4r & 1\\end{aligned}]?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/state.json" "file_sha256" "ef0ef501505ad15b3d918fd486037e8f3ae2d9f64de5fbc1634c9290ec735998"} {"question" "q-1099" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we remove the third row and second column:\n\n$$\nD=[\\begin{aligned}3s & ∗ & 2t \\\\ -r & ∗ & r \\\\ ∗ & 4r & ∗\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nNext, we calculate the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det[\\begin{aligned}3s & 2t \\\\ -r & r\\end{aligned}] & =|\\begin{aligned}3s & 2t \\\\ -r & r\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3s\\cdot r-2t\\cdot (-r) \\\\  & =3rs-(-2rt) \\\\  & =3rs+2rt\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/state.json" "file_sha256" "ef0ef501505ad15b3d918fd486037e8f3ae2d9f64de5fbc1634c9290ec735998"} {"question" "q-1099" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "10f9a01882929c805ae8f03f880f100764bc453c1ee7d0fe363e3949f3e61664"} {"question" "q-1099" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field